al:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered SSH service, accounts, key material, policy, and end-to-end access.","limitations":["Some post-restart effective-policy output has the passwordauthentication value redacted or malformed, but the earlier unredacted effective configuration and post-restart rejection of non-key authentication directly establish the required behavior.","The final lifecycle inventory shows one abandoned temporary file on node1 from a failed key-comparison attempt; its contents and size were not captured."]}
